{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】數碼通表示部分地區網絡服務不穩。</p>\n<p>數碼通在社交平台向客戶致歉，稱留意到部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，現正積極調查及跟進，會盡力減低對客戶的影響，會適時公布最新消息。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:23:24.298472+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:52.468959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:52.468959+00:00","content_hash":"bb5f29582c2b2d2f94a0ba1d30602901c366a18883c7436c3dbbd6c936b08412","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}